This repo is (or will be) full of classic games coded in c and run entirely inside the terminal (windows only).
Some of the games published here need more polishing and some fixes but the basic mechanics of the games are functionnal.

List of the games made so far (2):
Snake
Pong
Tetris(coming soon)


DISCLAIMER: No AI's were harmed (used) in the making of this project(not for writing at least)!!!
